                        <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_11500-21537282-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <ul>
	<li>Help the Engineer with right guides and process</li>
	<li>Requirements:
	<ul>
		<li>How users will get approval for all the repositories they need to contribute as per <a href="https://commbank.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CFTT/pages/2160130902/Open+Source+Contributions+Guidelines#4.-Approval-Process" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://commbank.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CFTT/pages/2160130902/Open+Source+Contributions+Guidelines#4.-Approval-Process</a></li>
		<li>Solution purely for audit trail, documentation purpose only</li>
		<li>Have all the right approvals</li>
		<li>Allow users to add more than one repo</li>
		<li>Checkbox to read the policy</li>
		<li>Proposed solution - “Self Service Portal?”</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Entry fields:
	<ul>
		<li>Engineer name and GHEC GitHub Handle (_cba)</li>
		<li>Engineer public Github Handle (TBD - personal information?)</li>
		<li>Engineers team and Line Manager;</li>
		<li>A description of the intended contribution;</li>
		<li>the business benefit to CBA;</li>
		<li>The specific changes you intend to make;</li>
		<li>whether the contribution involves AI-related or security-sensitive material.</li>
		<li>The open source repository URL;</li>
		<li>The repository licence and contribution agreement, where known;</li>
		<li>relevant risk considerations;</li>
		<li>the expected contribution period;</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Approval process:
	<ul>
		<li>Line-manager support → Users has to tag the CBA GHE Handle for the individual</li>
		<li>One approval from the Chief Engineer or Principal Engineer layer within your domain → Users has to tag the CBA GHE Handle for the individual</li>
		<li>One approval from the Open Source Reviewers layer → A new “Open Source Reviewers” team created in Self-Service Portal Org with predefined static list of GHEC users (New ticket to introduce Identity Group to sync)</li>
		<li>Approval from the Engineering Practice → A new “Open Source Reviewers” team created in Self-Service Portal Org with predefined static list of GHEC users (New ticket to introduce Identity Group to sync)</li>
		<li>Final approval and endorsement from Brendan Hopper in Group Strategy</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

  </td>
