    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>As an engineer I want to submit an open source contribution request so that we can push code to open source repository in GitHub</p>

<hr />

<p>Idea for the approval process:</p>

<p>Requestor will fill in the GHEC CBA handle for:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Line-manager support → Users has to tag the CBA GHE Handle for the individual</li>
	<li>One approval from the Chief Engineer or Principal Engineer layer within your domain</li>
</ul>


<p>Also, ideally this will have a phased workflow run so each step will run after the other. i.e: </p>

<ol>
	<li>Line-manager gets requested for approval</li>
	<li>after 1. approved, Chief Engineer or Principal Engineer gets requested for approval</li>
	<li>after 2. &lt;continue&gt;</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

