        <tr id="comment-body-19062227"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://commbank.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A820d018f-51ea-4c3e-bce9-9cedca33d51e" class="user-hover" rel="557058:820d018f-51ea-4c3e-bce9-9cedca33d51e" data-account-id="557058:820d018f-51ea-4c3e-bce9-9cedca33d51e" accountid="557058:820d018f-51ea-4c3e-bce9-9cedca33d51e" rel="noreferrer">Fabio Robibaro</a> In the guidelines it says that if they want to submit for another repository, they will have to submit another request.</p>
