        <tr id="comment-body-19063688"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Hi <a href="https://commbank.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=633bfc07a84c7f79c388ba81" class="user-hover" rel="633bfc07a84c7f79c388ba81" data-account-id="633bfc07a84c7f79c388ba81" accountid="633bfc07a84c7f79c388ba81" rel="noreferrer">Brent Mckendrick</a> , if you are okay with this approach, we would need the people(GitHub handles) that should approve from following groups</p>

